      'A cozy bookshop window at dusk. On the left, a stack of three cobalt-blue books; in the center, an orange tabby cat asleep on a red velvet cushion; on the right, a brass telescope on a wooden stand. A chalkboard sign in the window reads "OPEN UNTIL 9". Warm lamplight inside, rain streaks on the glass, photorealistic.',
